# Frontend environment variables (Vite).
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in as needed. NEVER commit `.env.local`.

# Base path for API calls. Defaults to "/api/v1", which the Vite dev server
# proxies to the backend (see vite.config.ts). Leave unset in development.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1

# Where the dev-server proxy forwards /api requests.
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Optional: a Google Maps *Demo Key* for rendering a Dynamic Map in the
# browser. A Demo Key is a browser credential by design and is expected to be
# visible in the bundle. It is only usable if you have obtained one and accept
# the Maps Demo Project terms (prototyping only, daily limits, no billing).
# Leave blank to keep maps disabled. See docs/google-maps.md.
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_DEMO_KEY=
